@authToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@skarbiec.local",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd!123"
}

### Dashboard — the user's latest snapshot (byAccount rows carry percentage of net worth; accountId null = assets outside accounts; byGroup rows likewise, groupId null = assets in no group, each with byAssetClass values summing to its valuePln; byAsset has one row per asset line of the snapshot: assetId, valuePln, priceDate, isStale)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Net worth history — range: 1M | 1Y | YTD | MAX (default 1Y), one point per snapshot date; response carries points (date, netWorthPln, isIncomplete = a line in scope has no price or rate that day, so the total leaves it out) plus changePln / changePercent (null without two points)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/net-worth-history?range=1Y
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Net worth history — one asset class (AssetClass int: 3 = Etf), 0 on days the class was not held
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/net-worth-history?range=1Y&assetClass=3
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Net worth history — one asset group (groupId from /api/portfolio/asset-groups), by each asset's current group; add &assetClass= to narrow it
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/net-worth-history?range=1Y&groupId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Net worth history — custom range: from and to together (yyyy-MM-dd, never with range; to is clamped to today); range comes back as CUSTOM, firstDate / lastDate are the user's first and last snapshot dates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/net-worth-history?from=2025-01-01&to=2025-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Net worth history — custom range with one asset class
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/net-worth-history?from=2025-03-15&to=2026-06-30&assetClass=3
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Net worth history — assets in no group (ungrouped=true cannot be combined with groupId: 400 Validation.InvalidGroupFilter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/net-worth-history?range=1Y&ungrouped=true
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
